# Cloudflare Pages Redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Cloudflare Pages enables "Pretty URLs" by default:
#   /products.html  -> 308 -> /products
#   /rfq.html       -> 308 -> /rfq
# So alias targets must point to the pretty URL, not the .html file.

# Common alias redirects (improves UX & SEO)
/quote       /rfq       301
/contact     /rfq       301
/get-quote   /rfq       301
/catalog     /products  301
/about-us    /about     301
/company     /about     301
/privacy     /privacy   301
/terms       /terms     301
/cookies     /cookies   301
